admitted, `assigned_scopes=1`, same coverage\n145|  line): `--section 7.8` exit 0, `--section 10.2` exit 0 (logs\n146|  `sections/section-7.8.log`, `sections/section-10.2.log`).\n147|- Pin tests merged (figure tables to the measured 152/69/4/9/9/43/\n148|  4/7/574/70; `forty-three` added to the closed number-word map;\n149|  rederivation map carries both stories' new cases); `traceability`\n150|  + `cmd/tracecheck` suites green including\n151|  `TestREADMEMeasuredCoverageMatchesTracecheckReport` and\n152|  `TestV070RegistryRederivesFromTrunkV060Registry`.\n153|- README: all six package sections present (trunk's\n154|  axpane/terminstance/termbind + this story's\n155|  clonebundle/clonesnap/cloneproject); measured-coverage subsection\n156|  rewritten to the measured figures with the 7.8/10.2 full-binding\n157|  prose transplanted (fenced line byte-equal; pin tests green).\n158|- LOGBOOK: REV4 + REV4 REFRESH lines appended to the leaf block\n159|  (newest-first preserved; history not rewritten).\n160|- `task-board.config.json` byte-identical to trunk (no validation\n161|  command added; verified with `cmp`).\n162|\n163|## Validation reran (this run, final tree — nothing accepted from prior runs)\n164|\n165|All 30 configured commands (read from the candidate\n166|`task-board.config.json`, `spawn.worktree_isolation.validation.commands`),\n167|exits observed firsthand (logs `cmds/cmd01.log` … `cmds/cmd30.log`\n168|in the archive; race gate as `cmd05a` … `cmd05g`; every log carries\n169|its command line + output + exit):\n170|\n171|- 1 gofmt check: 0. 2 build: 0. 3 vet: 0.\n172|- 4 `go test ./... -count=1 -v`: 0 — 44 packages `ok`, 2794\n173|  top-level PASS, zero FAIL.\n174|- 5 race gate: 0 in 7 bounded groups (8+7+7+7+7+7+1 = 44\n175|  packages `ok`, zero `DATA RACE`, zero FAIL; `sessquery` alone\n176|  in group G), each with `-timeout 25m`, instead of one long call\n177|  per the headless time bound.\n178|- 6 cover gate: 0 — 44 `ok`; `cloneproject` 91.7% of statements.