refusal row reddens. Every other unknown result member still refuses.\\nok: N-actor-empty-subagent-name: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the empty subagent name past the shape arm; the record still refuses one step later at the actor mapping with its different message, so the killer pins the shape message (message pin).\\nok: N-unterminated-tail-drop: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Labelled behaviour drop (not a narrowing): drops the unterminated last line of a multi-line member, so the tail event is missing and its asserted offset reddens; single-line and newline-terminated members are unaffected.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1250,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 313,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
