{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ea27","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b4ea-fb92-7cf3-9cd5-04cb5a5f5467"},"sequence":4974,"recorded_at":1780531400009943,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"16aac74a-8f80-4da1-94ce-cabce45ae87b","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"16aac74a-8f80-4da1-94ce-cabce45ae87b","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"16aac74a-8f80-4da1-94ce-cabce45ae87b"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nTASK-260830-32ypr2 revision 5 is constructed from the uncommitted Story worktree (branch tip still `5cc9449`, trunk unmoved at `42d5a95`, no refresh needed). All 19 checklist items checked; results, matrix, and evidence archive attached and digest-verified.\n\nWhat this rework closed (test-plus-matrix only, no production change):\n- **P2-f**: 7 far-edge refusal rows in `internal/clonebundle` (parents 65, heads 1025, actors 1025, event IDs 1000001 — build and decode, each asserting code + message) plus 8 widening narrowings and the decode-side unsorted-refs row. Build-side plants kill by admission; matrix §D and clonebundle TRACEABILITY now cite rows by name.\n- **P3-bb/cc/dd/ee**: unterminated-tail test with asserted offsets, two per-type registry rows with a seven-site census in results, output-axis usage overflow, decode-side distinct-unsorted raw_refs — each with its narrowing.\n- **P3-ff/gg/hh**: CRLF stated and pinned by test, matrix name fixed, `forty-seven` dropped, empty-`subagent:` row shipped as an honest message pin.\n\nMeasured evidence: cloneproject battery 86/86 twice, clonebundle 76/76 twice, clonesnap 44/44 once (all with per-plant raw logs + exits); full 30-command suite green (44 packages, 2796 PASS, race clean in 7 groups); tracecheck `70/574` with the pin re-proven by the zeroed-pin gate print.","reason":null}}
